message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "dmg-quito-final: analysis code for 'Gestational diabetes mellitus detected under routine risk-based screening in Quito, Ecuador'"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/santiagopediatra/dmg-quito-gdm-analysis"
authors:
  - given-names: Paola
    family-names: Toapanta-Pinta
