abstract: >-
  R code for a prospective cohort study of gestational diabetes mellitus (GDM)
  in 523 pregnant women in Quito, Ecuador (2021-2023). It estimates GDM
  cumulative incidence under the recorded diagnosis and a restricted
  operational definition, factors associated with GDM, and maternal and
  neonatal outcomes. Individual-level data are not included.
keywords:
  - gestational diabetes
  - screening
  - Ecuador
  - cohort
  - R
